WEBVTT

00:00.880 --> 00:02.280
Alright

00:02.640 --> 00:03.840
To act this way

00:03.920 --> 00:05.320
Is too risky

00:05.400 --> 00:06.560
The Chen family's problem

00:06.640 --> 00:08.040
We'll find another way

00:08.560 --> 00:09.720
It's getting late

00:09.800 --> 00:11.200
Go back and rest

00:11.440 --> 00:12.840
Yes

00:16.500 --> 00:21.000
A few months later, Prince Ning and Chen Wan'er, eldest daughter of the Chen family, exchanged marriage letters and entered into an engagement.

00:21.600 --> 00:26.200
A year and a half later, at Prince Ning's royal wedding, you drank several cups with Father Emperor at the banquet, feeling slightly dizzy.

00:26.800 --> 00:32.200
While cooling off in the courtyard breeze, you took a hangover soup from a maid... After drinking it, a surge of burning heat consumed your chest, and you blacked out...

00:32.800 --> 00:36.500
When you awoke once more...

